    "11:_": "Seif 11 and the same if. There 71a Mishnah and see there 31b Rashi s.v. eruvei, etc.:",
    "12:_": "Seif 12 guardian. For it is no worse than his hired worker and gatherer. There 64a:",
    "14:_": "Seif 14 one blesses. Shabbat 23a:",
    "15:א": "Seif 15 when, etc. Pesachim 6b, Menachot 35b — from the time of, etc.:",
    "15:ב": "And he says. See siman 524 in the nusach of eruvei tavshilin in the name of Yerushalmi:",
    "15:ג": "And if they gathered. Berachos 15a:"
